# PC card pc-melee-gun (docs/plan-melee-top5.md, MGUN-17..20, BENCH-143): one build alone on today's whole melee field, 46 fields x 6 seeds (3234-3239, after the surf card's 3225-3230 and its cloud smokes' 3230-3232), at the machine's melee width (@C@, fixed at prep) and CPU constant. Template: mgprep writes work/melee-gun-<arm>.args with @V@ = the robot.release in hadur-robot/pom.xml and @A@ = the arm's suffix (aa, bb, gx, gr, gd, gv); every arm fights the same fields and seeds, so the read pairs them battle for battle.
--suite
melee-census-317.txt
--seeds
6
--seed-base
3233
--rounds
35
--parallel
@C@
--child-heap
2G
--cpu-constant
auto
--robot-jar
bisect/hadur117.Hadur_@V@@A@.jar
--robot
hadur117.Hadur @V@@A@
--out
work/melee-gun-@V@-@A@
--report
